  "title": "Spaghetti with Tomato and Sausage Sauce",
  "description": "Smoked sausage, fresh mushrooms and red wine are simmered all afternoon with tomatoes, garlic, oregano, basil, parsley and sugar. Serve this rich and hearty sauce over hot pasta, and top with grated Parmesan.",
  "authors": [
    "Melinda"
